\ Test/vocabularies.atl
\ Test suite for Vocabularies and Search Order in ATLAST

"--- Testing Vocabularies and Search Order ---" type CR

\ 1. Initial State
"Initial search order and vocabs:" type CR
ORDER
VOCS

\ 2. Create Vocabulary EDITOR
VOCABULARY EDITOR
"After VOCABULARY EDITOR:" type CR
VOCS

\ 3. Define words in EDITOR
ALSO EDITOR DEFINITIONS
"Search order while defining in EDITOR:" type CR
ORDER

: HELLO-ED "Hello from EDITOR vocabulary!" type CR ;
: CMD1 100 . CR ;
: SHARED-FN 111 . CR ;

"Words defined in EDITOR:" type CR
WORDS

\ 4. Return to FORTH
ONLY FORTH DEFINITIONS
"Search order after ONLY FORTH DEFINITIONS:" type CR
ORDER

: HELLO-FORTH "Hello from FORTH vocabulary!" type CR ;
: CMD2 200 . CR ;
: SHARED-FN 222 . CR ;

"Testing FORTH definitions:" type CR
HELLO-FORTH
CMD2
SHARED-FN

\ 5. Verify Isolation: ED words not visible in FORTH
"Testing isolation (EDITOR words should not shadow unless in search order):" type CR
SHARED-FN \ should print 222

\ 6. Add EDITOR to search order
ALSO EDITOR
"Search order with ALSO EDITOR:" type CR
ORDER

"Testing EDITOR precedence over FORTH:" type CR
SHARED-FN \ should print 111
CMD1      \ should print 100
CMD2      \ should print 200 from FORTH

\ 7. Drop EDITOR with PREVIOUS
PREVIOUS
"Search order after PREVIOUS:" type CR
ORDER
SHARED-FN \ should print 222

\ 8. Test CONTEXT and CURRENT variables
"Testing CONTEXT and CURRENT variables:" type CR
ALSO EDITOR
: TEST-VARS-1
    CONTEXT @ CURRENT @ <> IF "PASS: CONTEXT != CURRENT" type CR THEN
;
TEST-VARS-1
DEFINITIONS
: TEST-VARS-2
    CONTEXT @ CURRENT @ = IF "PASS: DEFINITIONS set CURRENT = CONTEXT" type CR THEN
;
TEST-VARS-2

\ 9. Test ANSI Search Order words
ONLY FORTH DEFINITIONS
VOCABULARY GRAPHICS
ALSO GRAPHICS
GET-ORDER
"GET-ORDER returned count: " type . CR
CLEAR

-1 SET-ORDER
"After -1 SET-ORDER (default reset):" type CR
ORDER

\ 10. Test FORGET with vocabularies
"Testing FORGET on vocabulary:" type CR
VOCABULARY TEMP-VOC
ALSO TEMP-VOC DEFINITIONS
: TEMP-W 999 . CR ;
VOCS
ONLY FORTH DEFINITIONS
FORGET TEMP-VOC
"After FORGET TEMP-VOC:" type CR
VOCS
ORDER

"--- All vocabulary tests completed successfully ---" type CR
